# Building the sdist and wheel (Publish and Malware scan) and checking the
# distribution metadata before upload, compiled to build.txt with exact
# versions and hashes. The builds run without build isolation, so the
# hatchling backend is pinned here instead of floating in an isolated
# environment. Dependabot proposes each new release.
#
# Regenerate from .github/requirements/:
#   uv pip compile build.in --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 -o build.txt
